Body:
Okay so I tried reproducing and immediately hit the same issue as u, I made a pr to make our error handling better but even when it's better their error isnt rlly enough. 

I did end up figuring out it was because the mcp urls need to be very specific even if u select a different region when doing the oauth flow. 

```
 "datadog": {
      "type": "remote",

      // The url I copied from the docs:
      // "url": "https://mcp.datadoghq.com/v1/mcp",
      "url": "https://mcp.us5.datadoghq.com/v1/mcp",
      "enabled": true,
    },
```

I copied that first url from docs and kept hitting the issue, but I changed to the second one (where my account is based) and it fixed it

Hope this helps
